{"unit_id":"tag:00X9:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下面给出一个适合我们目的的拓扑斯（topos）定义。具体而言，拓扑斯（topos）是位点（site）上的层（sheaves）所成的范畴（category）。要指定拓扑斯（topos），只需指定位点（site）。拓扑斯（topos）与位点（site）的真正区别在于态射（morphisms）的定义。事实上，有许多拓扑斯态射（morphisms of topoi）并不来自底层（underlying）位点（sites）的态射（morphisms）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphisms of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"underlying","target_term":"底层"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"定义为位点上的层范畴"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"用于指定拓扑斯的位点"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"组成拓扑斯的层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"层范畴"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"两种态射概念的区别"},{"source_term":"morphisms of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射","context":"未必来自位点态射的态射"},{"source_term":"underlying","target_term":"底层","context":"给出拓扑斯的底层位点"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"拓扑斯的表示位点"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00XA:statement","translation":"拓扑斯（Topoi）<OWNARGEND_0001>一个<TEXTITOPEN_0001>拓扑斯（topos）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是范畴（category）<MATH_0001>，由位点（site）<MATH_0002> 上的层（sheaves）组成。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 设 <MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004> 为位点（sites）。一个<TEXTITOPEN_0002>拓扑斯态射（morphism of topoi）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002> <MATH_0005>，从 <MATH_0006> 到 <MATH_0007>，由一对函子（functors）\n<MATH_0008>\n和\n<MATH_0009>\n给出，使得\n<STRUCT_0003>\n<STRUCT_0004> 有\n<MATH_0010>，\n且具有双函子性（bifunctorially），并且\n<STRUCT_0005> 函子（functor）<MATH_0011> 与有限极限（finite limits）交换（commutes），即是左正合的（left exact）。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n<STRUCT_0007> 设 <MATH_0012>、<MATH_0013>、<MATH_0014> 为位点（sites）。给定拓扑斯态射（morphisms of topoi）<MATH_0015> 和 <MATH_0016>，其<TEXTITOPEN_0003>复合（composition）<MATH_0017><TEXTITCLOSE_0003>是由函子（functors）<MATH_0018> 和 <MATH_0019> 定义的拓扑斯态射（morphism of topoi）。\n<STRUCT_0008>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"bifunctorially","target_term":"双函子性"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"finite limits","target_term":"有限极限"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"left exact","target_term":"左正合的"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphisms of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"命名定义的标题"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"层范畴的名称"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"层范畴"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"层的定义域"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"拓扑斯中的对象"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"定义态射及复合的位点"},{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射","context":"具有左正合左伴随的一对函子"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"定义态射及其复合的函子"},{"source_term":"bifunctorially","target_term":"双函子性","context":"伴随公式对两个变量的函子性"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"需保持有限极限的拉回"},{"source_term":"finite limits","target_term":"有限极限","context":"拉回保持的极限"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"拉回与有限极限交换"},{"source_term":"left exact","target_term":"左正合的","context":"有限极限保持性"},{"source_term":"morphisms of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射","context":"两个给定的可复合态射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"拓扑斯态射的复合"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00X9:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n假设 <MATH_0001> 是可能为“大（big）”的范畴（categories）之间的等价（equivalence）。如果 <MATH_0002>、<MATH_0003> 是拓扑斯（topoi），那么令 <MATH_0004>，并令 <MATH_0005> 等于 <MATH_0006> 的拟逆（quasi-inverse），就给出态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>，它是拓扑斯（topoi）之间的。并且，这个态射（morphism）在拓扑斯（topoi）的 <MATH_0008>-范畴（category）中是等价（equivalence）（见第 <REF_0001> 节）。因此，当 <MATH_0010> 等价（equivalent）于位点（site）上的层（sheaves）范畴（category）（未必等于位点（site）上的层（sheaves）范畴（category））时，说“<MATH_0009> 是拓扑斯（topos）”是有意义的。我们偶尔会这样滥用记号。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001>空（empty）拓扑斯（topos）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是位点（site）<MATH_0011> 上的层（sheaves）的拓扑斯（topos），其中 <MATH_0012> 为空（empty）范畴（category）。我们有时将这个位点（site）记为 <MATH_0013>。这个位点（site）有唯一的层（sheaf）（因为 <MATH_0014> 没有对象（objects））。因此 <MATH_0015> 等价（equivalent）于只有一个对象（object）和一个态射（morphism）的范畴（category）。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n<TEXTITOPEN_0002>点状（punctual）拓扑斯（topos）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>是位点（site）<MATH_0016> 上的层（sheaves）的拓扑斯（topos），该位点只有一个对象（object）<MATH_0017> 和一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0018>，其唯一覆盖（covering）是覆盖（covering）<MATH_0019>。我们将这个位点（site）简单记为 <MATH_0020>。显然，层（sheaves）范畴（category）<MATH_0021> 预层（presheaves）范畴（category）<MATH_0022> 集合（sets）范畴（category）。用公式表示为 <MATH_0023>。\n\n<STRUCT_0006><STRUCT_0007>\n设 <MATH_0024> 和 <MATH_0025> 为位点（sites）。设 <MATH_0026> 为拓扑斯态射（morphism of topoi）。注意，<MATH_0027> 与所有极限（limits）交换（commutes），而 <MATH_0028> 与所有余极限（colimits）交换（commutes），见范畴（Categories）引理 <REF_0002>。特别地，上面定义中对 <MATH_0029> 的条件，保证 <MATH_0030> 是正合的（exact）。拓扑斯态射（Morphisms of topoi）常利用引理 <REF_0003> 或下面的引理来构造。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"quasi-inverse","target_term":"拟逆"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{