{"unit_id":"tag:00XB:statement","translation":"（与拓扑斯态射（morphisms of topoi）有关的集合（Set）论问题。初读时可跳过。）\n如上定义的拓扑斯态射（morphism of topoi）不是集合（set），而是类（class）。换言之，它由数学公式（mathematical formula）给出，而非数学对象（mathematical object）。虽然可以考虑两个给定拓扑斯（topoi）之间所有态射（morphisms）的总体，但将其作为数学对象（mathematical object）引入并不好。另一方面，假设 <MATH_0001> 和 <MATH_0002> 为给定的位点（sites）。考虑函子（functor）<MATH_0003>。这样的事物是集合（set），换言之，是数学对象（mathematical object）。我们可以依次对 <MATH_0004> 提出以下问题。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 给定层（sheaf）<MATH_0005>（定义于 <MATH_0006> 上），规则\n<MATH_0007>\n是否在 <MATH_0008> 上定义一个层（sheaf）？若是，这就定义函子（functor）<MATH_0009>。\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0010> 是否有左伴随（left adjoint）？若是，用 <MATH_0011> 表示这个左伴随（left adjoint）。\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0012> 是否是正合的（exact）？\n<STRUCT_0005>\n如果最后一个问题的回答仍是“是”，则得到拓扑斯态射（morphism of topoi）<MATH_0013>。并且，给定任意拓扑斯态射（morphism of topoi）<MATH_0014>，可以令 <MATH_0015>，得到上述函子（functor）<MATH_0016>，满足 <MATH_0017> 和 <MATH_0018>（与伴随（adjoint）性质相容）。总之，以 <MATH_0019> 的总体代替拓扑斯态射（morphisms of topoi）来工作，就 (a) 将拓扑斯态射（morphism of topoi）这一概念替换为数学对象（mathematical object），并且 (b) <MATH_0020> 的总体构成类（class）（而非类（classes）的总体）。当然，还可以进一步讨论，例如可以更精确地阐明上面条件 (2) 和 (3) 的意义；对于拓扑斯（topoi）的点（points），我们将在第 <REF_0001> 节这样做。\n","allowed_english":["a","b"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphisms of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"Set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"mathematical formula","target_term":"数学公式"},{"source_term":"mathematical object","target_term":"数学对象"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"mathematical object","target_term":"数学对象"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"mathematical object","target_term":"数学对象"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"left adjoint","target_term":"左伴随"},{"source_term":"left adjoint","target_term":"左伴随"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合的"},{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"morphisms of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"mathematical object","target_term":"数学对象"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"classes","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphisms of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射","context":"集合论大小问题中的态射总体"},{"source_term":"Set","target_term":"集合","context":"开头的集合论问题"},{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射","context":"以公式给出的拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"函子可作为集合对象"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类","context":"态射及所给函子总体的大小"},{"source_term":"mathematical formula","target_term":"数学公式","context":"与数学对象区分的公式"},{"source_term":"mathematical object","target_term":"数学对象","context":"可作为集合对象处理的数学事物"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"给定的两个拓扑斯及其点"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"两个拓扑斯之间的态射"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"固定的表示位点"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"可作为集合的表示函子"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"检验该表示函子给出的规则"},{"source_term":"left adjoint","target_term":"左伴随","context":"检验是否存在拉回"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合的","context":"检验拉回的正合性"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随","context":"表示同构与伴随性质相容"},{"source_term":"classes","target_term":"类","context":"避免形成类的总体"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点","context":"以后讨论的拓扑斯的点"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00XE:statement","translation":"（初读时可跳过。）\n设 <MATH_0001> 和 <MATH_0002> 为位点（sites）。位点（sites）的拟（quasi）态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>（见注记 <REF_0001>）给出拓扑斯态射（morphism of topoi）<MATH_0004>，从 <MATH_0005> 到 <MATH_0006>，与引理 <REF_0002> 中完全相同。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"quasi","target_term":"拟"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"给定的两个位点"},{"source_term":"quasi","target_term":"拟","context":"quasi-morphism的前缀"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"位点拟态射中的词根"},{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射","context":"由拟态射诱导的拓扑斯态射"}],"notes":[]}
